OL,3,AWeekend of mixed UK weather with
OL,4,Asunshine before showers arrive for some
OL,5,Aon Sunday
OL,6,
OL,7,FA deep area of low pressure is forecast
OL,8,Fto approach from the Atlantic next week
OL,9,Fbringing a spell of windy weather.
OL,11,FThis potential storm may also bring
OL,12,Fheavy rain to places, especially in the
OL,13,Fwest, whilst some places further east
OL,14,Fcould stay dry.
OL,16,FMany drought affected parts of England
OL,17,Fand Wales - where significant rainfall
OL,18,Fis still needed - may stay largely dry
OL,19,Fthroughout the next week.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
