OL,3,AWeekend of mixed UK weather with
OL,4,Asunshine before showers arrive for some
OL,5,Aon Sunday
OL,6,
OL,7,FBefore the arrival of wind and rain,
OL,8,Fthough, some bursts of warmth will lift
OL,9,Ftemperatures above average, possibly
OL,10,Freaching the low-20s Celsius at times
OL,11,Fin south-east England.
